x86_64-linux  cxx1's element loops `__cxx1_vec_del_5Owned`, `__cxx1_vec_del_6Copied` and atexit helpers `__cxx1_vec_exit_fileOwned`, `__cxx1_vec_exit__ZL9sumStaticv.held` against clang's `__cxx_global_array_dtor` pair, as array-static-storage.nonames records; a static local is `_ZL9sumStaticv.held` with its guard beside it where clang writes `_ZZL9sumStaticvE4held` - CLAUDE.md, a static local named by its mangled symbol; and no `__cxa_guard_abort`, the guarded construction having no landing pad (CONFORMANCE.md). The objects and functions the program declares agree.
